{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","丛林之怒"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","被动地，自身获得可自动恢复的“树藤之护”护盾。主动释放时，持续挥舞大刀对面前的敌人造成伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动地，战斗开始时自身失去70%的生命值，获得至多可抵御120% + 12% HP伤害的“树藤之护”护盾，“树藤之护”每秒自动恢复10% + 1% HP的护盾值，其存在时自身处于霸体状态。“树藤之护”被击破时，进入3秒的冷却，冷却结束后“树藤之护”护盾量直接恢复至45% HP。\n主动释放时，缇洛亚挥舞大刀8次，每次挥刀对前方2格扇形范围内敌人造成两次60% ATK伤害。期间获得70%减伤效果，且每受到4次伤害后使挥刀次数增加一次，至多挥刀12次。如果范围内没有敌人，会朝最近的敌人突进后继续挥刀。本技能的主动效果不受急速影响。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":32,"end":38,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":68,"end":73,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":28,"end":41,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":65,"end":76,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":89,"end":91,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":132,"end":138,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":176,"end":183,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时，每次挥刀造成的伤害提升至65% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时，每次挥刀造成的伤害提升至70% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时，每次挥刀造成的伤害提升至75% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时，每次挥刀造成的伤害提升至80% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","猛力劈斩"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","对目标发起一次蓄力戳刺，并恢复“树藤之护”护盾。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","缇洛亚短暂蓄力后对当前目标发起一次强力攻击，造成220% ATK伤害，“树藤之护”存在时，还会回复实际伤害量160% + 15%的“树藤之护”护盾。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":58,"end":64,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":24,"end":32,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","造成伤害提高至230% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":15,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","造成伤害提高至240% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":15,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","造成伤害提高至250% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":15,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","藤刃共鸣"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","使大刀与植物产生共鸣，接下来一段时间内自身对敌人造成伤害时会附加基于自身护盾量的伤害。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","缇洛亚使大刀与植物产生共鸣，接下来10秒内对敌人造成伤害时，会额外附加自身当前护盾量6% + 1%的伤害，附加伤害至多不超过200% ATK。使用该技能时自身2格范围内每有1名友军，增益效果时间延长3.5秒。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":44,"end":49,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":62,"end":70,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","附加伤害提升至自身当前护盾量的7% + 1%。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":22,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","附加伤害提升至自身当前护盾量的8% + 1%。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":22,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","附加伤害提升至自身当前护盾量的9% + 1%。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":22,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身受愈。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的受愈提升11点。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的受愈提升15点。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的受愈提升19点。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","自然滋长"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","“树藤之护”被击破后，恢复的护盾量获得提升。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","“树藤之护”首次被击破时，不再具有冷却时间，直接获得120% HP的护盾量。后续“树藤之护”被击破时，冷却期后的回复量提升至60% HP。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":26,"end":33,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":62,"end":68,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“树藤之护”冷却期后的回复量提升至70% HP。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","“树藤之护”累计存在15秒后，增强与植物的共鸣，使处于自身2格范围内所有友军提升40%的最大生命值和60%护甲魔抗。友军通过本技能获得的最大生命值不超过缇洛亚自身初始最大生命值的80%。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","“树藤之护”冷却期后的回复量提升至80% HP。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","终极技能期间提升“树藤之护”的恢复速度。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","终极技能期间，“树藤之护”恢复速度提升至每秒15% HP。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":22,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","蔓织锋刀"]]}